{"_path":"/book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries","_dir":"book","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"たのしいバイナリの歩き方","description":"","director":"Kenji Aiko","time":"2026","img":"a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries/1.png","plan":"1,100","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"book-content","props":{":by":"director",":img":"img",":plan":"plan",":title":"title"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"text-title","props":{":t":"为什么我不学逆向？"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在那个信息匮乏的年代，想学逆向要么啃书要么看视频。但就算是看了视频也没有什么帮助，因为涉及底层学起来还是很枯燥的，不像是 Web Security 找个靶场或者 Google 黑语法 "},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":[]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"inurl:php? intitle:新闻动态"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 就能检验最新学到的 OWASP TOP 10。跑一跑最新学到的 sqlmap。而逆向学的就多了，开始就是 IDA PRO，不像是 Burp 就一个抓包，改改参数。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"随着 AI 越来越强，我自己也尝试了下 Artex，接入了 deepseek-flash。确实比我聪明和厉害许多，因为我至今从未弱密码成功过，也没进入过任何一个企业的后台，而它做到了。我下达的任务非常简单，就是 "},{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"拿下后台的管理员权限"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 总共花了五块钱不到。但人总是贪心的，进入到后台后我又想获取服务器和数据库权限。但花了差不多 ¥60 仍然处于信息搜集阶段："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"text-tip","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一开始我选择了 deepseek-pro 因为我觉得 pro 肯定比 flash 厉害许多，结果通过朋友得知 pro 又慢又贵还不聪明，白白浪费了 ¥49.16 大洋。"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"text-flow","props":{"file":"/img/book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries/artex-exploration-graph-task-8-20261022T070916Z-redacted.json","height":560,"title":"Artex 探索流程"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"所以在看本书之前，我会先尝试下 AI 时代特有的方式，例如 REA 和 Artex，前者针对逆向，后者则是 Web 渗透。我希望自己通过 rust 编译一个密钥发卡程序，然后连接服务器，然后加壳做一个测试 demo。看看 REA 能不能绕过我的 API 校验实现破解 Adobe 类似的效果。而 Artex 则是随便找一个生产环境进行测试。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"简陋的发卡程序测试"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"简陋的发卡程序测试"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Codex 额度充值之前，我直接 GPT-6.1 Astra Ultra 让他帮我生成一个前端 QT 后端 rust 并且加壳的 demo。一开始它选的是 "},{"type":"element","tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.vmpsoft.com/","rel":["nofollow"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"VMProtect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" ，但是这个要花钱（不过好像一般都是用盗版的）。于是我让 GPT 帮我用开源的，它找到了 "},{"type":"element","tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://github.com/und3ath/xollvm","rel":["nofollow"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"xollvm"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 有一说一才 156 个 star。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h3","props":{"id":"llvm"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"LLVM"}]}]}],"toc":{"title":"","searchDepth":2,"depth":2,"links":[{"id":"简陋的发卡程序测试","depth":2,"text":"简陋的发卡程序测试","children":[{"id":"llvm","depth":3,"text":"LLVM"}]}]}},"_type":"markdown","_id":"content:book:a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries.md","_source":"content","_file":"book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries.md","_extension":"md","sitemap":{"loc":"https://m.ritsu.jiangxue.org/book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries"},"head":{"script":[{"id":"nuxt-og-image-overrides","type":"application/json","processTemplateParams":true,"innerHTML":"[{\"title\":1,\"excerpt\":-1,\"component\":2},\"たのしいバイナリの歩き方\",\"OgImageCustom\"]","tagPosition":"bodyClose","tagPriority":30}],"meta":[{"property":"og:image","content":"/__og-image__/static/book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries/og.png"},{"property":"og:image:width","content":1200},{"property":"og:image:height","content":600},{"property":"og:image:type","content":"image/png"},{"property":"og:image:alt"},{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"},{"name":"twitter:image:src","content":"/__og-image__/static/book/a-fun-guide-to-exploring-binaries/og.png"},{"name":"twitter:image:width","content":1200},{"name":"twitter:image:height","content":600},{"name":"twitter:image:alt"}]}}